%SIXMD 1
# @?SYSCTL - PRINT CURRENT SYSTEM RESOURCE STATE

## DESCRIPTION

SYSCTL IS THE COMPATIBILITY NAME FOR THE EARLY DAIMOSV1 STATUS COMMAND.  THE
OLD SYSCTL OID ABI WAS REMOVED.  CURRENT DAIMOS REPORTS THE STABLE MEMORY,
PROCESS SLOT, FILE SLOT, AND MEMFS COUNTERS PROVIDED BY THE NORMAL SYSTEM
INTERFACES; STRUCTURED PROCESS, DOMAIN, AND DEVICE STATE LIVES IN MONITORFS.

USAGE IS 'SYSCTL'.

## @?FILES

### @?/MONITOR
STRUCTURED LIVE SYSTEM STATE.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - STATUS WAS PRINTED
### @?1 - STATUS COULD NOT BE READ

## @?SEE ALSO

### @?MEMSTAT
### @?PS
### @?DEVS
